<title>UK: Daimler unit sets 125 mln SFR Sept 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Daimler unit sets 125 mln SFR Sept 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch Switzerland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DAIMLER-BENZ NORTH AMERICA CORP</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DAIMLER-BENZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.125     MATURITY    25.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE   S25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
